    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ab48f8d56c4884f30017dd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一位身着黑西装的马娘满脸慌张，\r\n以难以置信的速度飞驰而来。\r\n——她就是美妙姿势的护卫队队长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3919603f09876cf60a124c95e945f7b15de713afc19ce7dfb65cc44668d1e191",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
