    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b86a8cc53df86b5c4050a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "万万不可！殿下的玉体绝不能有任何闪失！\r\n毕竟您可是无可替代的存在……\r\n您父亲也亲自叮嘱过，绝不可让您出任何意外！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d2c761568ab3ca7eb2b6a74cbfe41b0e7ca8e55c22fcb9fce35a69efe06a01a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b82d83edb0a0051a8a2b9c91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——美妙姿势，是某国的王室成员。\r\n她这样身份高贵的赛马娘来到这里留学，\r\n是有着『绝对安全』这一条件的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e5d8f828df13e53ccf218acaa506626d69ce69e52cf14bd9240233aeb936039",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022100.json",
      "json_path": [
